Spinal Cord Toolbox web app segmentation, extracted from apps/spinalcordtoolbox
in neurodesk/webapps. Imported application source: NOASSERTION.
No blanket MIT license is asserted for this package.

Models: ONNX conversions of Spinal Cord Toolbox (SCT) deep-learning models
(contrast-agnostic spinal cord, gray matter, SCIsegV2, MS lesion single fold)
and TotalSpineSeg step 1, hosted at pinned revisions of the Hugging Face dataset
sbollmann/sct-webapp-data. Sources and versions are listed per model in
model.manifest.json; their licences are those of the upstream releases.
The portable release includes only the spinalcord model.

Spinal Cord Toolbox:
De Leener B, Lévy S, Dupont SM, et al. SCT: Spinal Cord Toolbox, an open-source
software for processing spinal cord MRI data. NeuroImage. 2017;145:24-43.
doi:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2016.10.009.

sct-webapp is not the native Spinal Cord Toolbox.
Shared webapp-components: MIT, included in its dependency LICENSE.
ONNX Runtime: MIT, included in its dependency distribution.
